    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bed1788ab474e3537a13c6323b786e80.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bed1788ab474e3537a13c6323b786e80.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bed1788ab474e3537a13c6323b786e80.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class-based MMORPG with group mechanics</h2>Oathbound is an MMORPG developed in Unreal Engine 5 that combines the traditional, rock-paper-scissors approach of established MMORPG classes (e.g. World of Warcraft) with turn-based tactical combat (e.g. Baldur\u2019s Gate) and a scalable world design (e.g. Wartales). As a free stand-alone version Oathbound: Arena lets you experience the game`s major features with an emphasis on PvE/PvP combat and skill systems \u2013 allowing players to try out different group layouts and practice before they eventually join the battle for Arcaya.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/6a97acea1ff8b3ef7e425f09bc64dea0.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/6a97acea1ff8b3ef7e425f09bc64dea0.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/6a97acea1ff8b3ef7e425f09bc64dea0.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>MMORPG Classes: Choose from accessible classes with unique skills.<br></li><li>Party Management: Experiment with different builds for different play styles.<br></li><li>Online Multiplayer: Excel in PvP/PvE combat and team up with friends in group battles.<br></li><li>Multiple Arenas: Adapt your strategy to different environments and fight for loot.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/3e2385d20b4c19a097c9e5ac77d14d17.avif?t=1689352081\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/c8930148641b1982dfcc37e782788fcd.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/c8930148641b1982dfcc37e782788fcd.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/c8930148641b1982dfcc37e782788fcd.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based Tactical Combat </h2>Oathbound's combat system is designed to encourage players to explore different builds and counter certain play strategies. Classes and counter-classes, skills and counter-skills follow the rock-paper-scissors approach to gain an in-game advantage by mastering the game's mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/0ec3635f265ae1ac19edaf48b1969e8c.avif?t=1689352081\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bdc94be294a88cd61a7969f03b88ecbe.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bdc94be294a88cd61a7969f03b88ecbe.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bdc94be294a88cd61a7969f03b88ecbe.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive World Map </h2>Explore the game world in 3D representation and discover clickable elements, such as houses or old ruins. Natural borders limit the accessible map section in an immersive manner. Points of Interest grant access to smaller, dedicated 3D maps upon click.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/5f07387da46dd2ced569aff4e243ec6c.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/5f07387da46dd2ced569aff4e243ec6c.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/5f07387da46dd2ced569aff4e243ec6c.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explorable Biomes</h2>Explore dedicated areas of the game world in 3rd person view. Collect resources, interact with other players or trade in confined point of interest maps of varying sizes.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/729b5223fb0991b71829a414c4e8e28f.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/729b5223fb0991b71829a414c4e8e28f.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/729b5223fb0991b71829a414c4e8e28f.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Oathbound Community</h2>The development of Oathbound and Oathbound: Arena is carried out in close and transparent exchange with the community. Playtests and Early Access are incorporated into the development roadmap \u2013 join the community and be a part of it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/4867142ac04ca90227c2f9f26fe0fa84.avif?t=1689352081\" /></span><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bed1788ab474e3537a13c6323b786e80.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bed1788ab474e3537a13c6323b786e80.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/bed1788ab474e3537a13c6323b786e80.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class-based MMORPG with group mechanics</h2>Oathbound is an MMORPG developed in Unreal Engine 5 that combines the traditional, rock-paper-scissors approach of established MMORPG classes (e.g. World of Warcraft) with turn-based tactical combat (e.g. Baldur\u2019s Gate) and a scalable world design (e.g. Wartales). As a free stand-alone version Oathbound: Arena lets you experience the game`s major features with an emphasis on PvE/PvP combat and skill systems \u2013 allowing players to try out different group layouts and practice before they eventually join the battle for Arcaya.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/6a97acea1ff8b3ef7e425f09bc64dea0.poster.avif?t=1689352081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/6a97acea1ff8b3ef7e425f09bc64dea0.webm?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/6a97acea1ff8b3ef7e425f09bc64dea0.mp4?t=1689352081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>MMORPG Classes: Choose from accessible classes with unique skills.<br></li><li>Party Management: Experimen