velopment of Oathbound and Oathbound: Arena is carried out in close and transparent exchange with the community. Playtests and Early Access are incorporated into the development roadmap \u2013 join the community and be a part of it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259400/extras/4867142ac04ca90227c2f9f26fe0fa84.avif?t=1689352081\" /></span><br>",
